"en": "Repeat Move Data String to String",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 57,
"where": "スライド8",
"en": "MOVS is one of number of instructions that can have the “rep” prefix added to it, which repeat a single instruction multiple times.",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 58,
"where": "スライド8",
"en": "MOVS is actually its own instruction which can be called without the REP instruction prefix",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 59,
"where": "スライド8",
"en": "All rep operations use *cx register as a “counter” to determine how many times to loop through the instruction. Each time it executes, it decrements *cx. Once *cx == 0, it continues to the next instruction",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 62,
"where": "スライド8",
"en": "Book page 101-102",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 64,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Repeat Move Data String to String",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 65,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "REP MOVS stores 1, 2, 4, or 8 bytes at a time",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 66,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Either fill 1 byte from [si] to [di] with or fill 1/2/4/8 bytes at a time from [*si] to [*di]",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 67,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Moves the *di and *si registers forward 1/2/4/8 at a time, so that the repeated store operation is storing into consecutive locations.",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 68,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "So there are 3 pieces which must happen before the actual rep movs occurs:",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 69,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Set *si to the start source",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 70,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Set *di to the start destination",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 71,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Set *cx to the number of times to store",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 74,
"where": "スライド9",
"en": "Book page 101-102",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 76,
"where": "スライド10",
"en": "Repeat Move Data String to String",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 77,
"where": "スライド10",
"en": "Note: Unlike MOV, MOVS can move memory to memory…but only between [*si] and [*di]",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 78,
"where": "スライド10",
"en": "A lot of people don’t pay attention to the fact that it’s REP MOVS, not REP MOV (even though you may say it like “rep-move”)",
"ja": ""
},
{
"i": 81,
"where": "スライド10",
